# 7. High-Level Technical Architecture

### Android Application

- Kotlin.
- Jetpack Compose.
- Room Database.
- Foreground Services.
- WorkManager.
- Android Bluetooth and telephony APIs.

### Backend

- Java.
- Spring Boot.
- REST APIs.
- PostgreSQL.
- JWT authentication.
- Firebase Cloud Messaging.

### Real-Time Communication

- WebRTC.
- Audio communication infrastructure.
- Real-time event distribution.

### Location

- Google Maps or compatible mapping provider.
- Background location management.
- Nearby rider discovery.

### AI

- LLM API integration.
- Vehicle-specific maintenance knowledge.
- Maintenance recommendation engine.

The architecture should be modular so that future marketplace, community, communication and AI capabilities can be introduced independently.

