# 8. Non-Functional Requirements

| Area | Requirement |
|---|---|
| Performance | Fast call detection and announcements |
| Battery | Optimised background consumption |
| Reliability | Graceful Bluetooth disconnection recovery |
| Security | Secure authentication and encrypted communication |
| Privacy | Explicit consent for contacts, location and recordings |
| Scalability | Support increasing community and communication usage |
| Availability | Reliable backend services |
| Offline support | Local garage records and supported offline functionality |
| Compatibility | Defined Android device and OS support |
| Accessibility | Voice-first controls and simple interaction |

### Riding Safety

- Minimise screen interaction during active riding.
- Use voice-first interaction.
- Keep controls simple.
- Avoid unnecessary visual notifications.
- Provide clear connectivity status.
- Prevent unintended actions through voice-command confirmation where appropriate.

