# 9. Business Model

AawaraRide will initially be completely free to use.

No mandatory paid subscription or premium tier will be introduced in the initial business model.

Core free features include:

- Riding Assistant.
- Call management.
- Digital Garage.
- Maintenance history.
- Distress requests.
- Community participation.
- Group communication.

Potential future revenue opportunities include affiliate commissions, marketplace commissions, brand partnerships, merchandise and commercial partnerships.

These opportunities will be evaluated without compromising access to essential rider safety features.

