# 11. Risks and Dependencies

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| Android call-management restrictions | Validate supported APIs through POC |
| Carrier voicemail limitations | Evaluate carrier forwarding and alternative approaches |
| Bluetooth headset incompatibility | Test multiple manufacturers |
| Battery consumption | Optimise background execution |
| Poor internet in remote locations | Offline-first design and mesh research |
| Low rider density | Launch with selected riding communities |
| False distress requests | Reporting and moderation |
| Unsafe user interaction | Voice-first interaction and riding-state restrictions |

